p in co-op mode.\n- Face off against creepy creatures like Granny, Ghosts, a Zombie Dog, and more.\n- High-quality VR graphics for an immersive, hair-raising experience.\n- Puzzles that challenge your brain while keeping your heart racing.\n- Exclusively available on Oculus Quest.", "short_description": "Get ready for a spooky adventure in Haunted Escape! You\u2019re trapped in a haunted room, and it\u2019s up to you to find a way out. Face creepy creatures like Granny, Ghosts, and even a Zombie Dog. Whether you're going solo or teaming up with a friend, every moment counts!"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/futlixgames/privacy-policy/meta-oculus-privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Futlix Games", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/futlixgames/home", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "644354873106712"}, {"id": "377978390272490"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "26877545548526805"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 15, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "27790384390637032"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "2973689859645191"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1729688638062790"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1673429023825226"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "703487932846222"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1755374109201497"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1260370